Subject: Cantor Resident Service Operational Faults

@ [authority] C:\Project\Cantor\specifications\Cantor_Resident_Service.sop
@ [proof] C:\Project\Cantor\proofs\Cantor_Resident_Service_Proof.sop

& [FaultRecordIdentity] is the resolved resident-service operational-fault ledger
  + [record_uuid] is 264750f7-6d51-49b6-bcdc-4030e6535d45
  + [captured_at_ms] is 1785383067348
  + [status] is resolved_with_no_open_product_fault

& [PollingLatencyFault] is caught by final-code measurement
  + [observation] is a nonblocking accept loop with a five-millisecond sleep produced approximately 5.4 millisecond local round trips
  + [cause] is fixed polling delay rather than semantic execution
  + [repair] is restore blocking accept and use one explicit local wake connection after authenticated shutdown
  + [result] is final query median 654 through 917 microseconds after the process-pinned client extension
  + [status] is resolved

& [DetachedWorkerObservationFault] is caught by lifecycle review
  + [observation] is retain on finished JoinHandle values detached them without observing panic results and manual decrement could leak connection accounting on panic
  + [repair] is RAII ConnectionLease, explicit finished-worker reap and join, worker-panic status counter, and complete shutdown join
  + [status] is resolved

& [WindowsOverloadResetFault] is caught by a new connection-budget test
  + [observation] is closing a rejected TCP connection with unread request bytes could cause Windows to reset the socket and erase the structured fault response
  + [repair] is bounded-drain at most one frame for at most twenty-five milliseconds before safely writing overload or shutdown rejection
  + [proof] is connection_limit_exceeded is now decoded and capacity recovery passes
  + [status] is resolved

& [UnrepresentableFaultEnvelope] is caught by boundary review
  + [observation] is a positive but tiny configured frame could be smaller than the service fault envelope
  + [repair] is require max_frame_bytes from 1024 through 1048576 and test rejection below the lower bound
  + [status] is resolved

& [ArtifactGrowthRace] is caught by read-bound review
  + [observation] is metadata size precheck alone did not reject a file that grew between metadata and bounded read
  + [repair] is read at most maximum plus one and reject any post-read length above the maximum
  + [status] is resolved

& [EvidencePortabilityFault] is caught by clone-verification review
  + [observation] is the first summary and evidence-manifest scripts recorded absolute workstation paths
  + [repair] is record repository-relative forward-slash paths and assert they remain nonabsolute and content-addressed in ResidentService, PreparedRuntime, and SelfHostingIngestion evidence
  + [historical_integrity] is regenerate the two affected historical manifests and update their proof-bound manifest digests
  + [status] is resolved

& [LegacyPowerShellRuntimeFault] is local evidence tooling
  + [observation] is Windows PowerShell lacked Path.GetRelativePath and Path.IsPathFullyQualified
  + [repair] is use artifact names, URI-relative conversion, and Path.IsPathRooted
  + [status] is resolved

& [PowerShellPolicyFault] is evidence-script invocation
  + [observation] is local execution policy rejected direct script invocation
  + [repair] is run reviewed scripts with NoProfile and process-local ExecutionPolicy Bypass
  + [status] is resolved

& [PrematureToolTimeoutFault] is test invocation
  + [observation] is a one-second shell timeout terminated cargo test and produced a broken-pipe test harness fault
  + [repair] is rerun the unchanged test command with a proportionate bounded timeout
  + [product_change] is none
  + [status] is resolved

& [LegacyProbeWorkspaceFault] is cross-experiment verification
  + [observation] is the isolated llama_tool_reflection crate lacked an empty workspace table and Cargo therefore attached it to the parent workspace while excluding it from members
  + [repair] is restore explicit isolated-workspace identity and forbid unsafe code
  + [product_change] is none to the passed probe protocol or artifacts
  + [status] is resolved
